Z||000000||Ferrari355||05-03-2000||04:54 PM||||Hello, we bought an 88 GT and were going to put all the panels on an 84 SE and i was wondering about the fastback because my dad doesn't seem to think that it will work. When you change from notchback to fastback what all is required like is there going to be any major changes like in the trunk space. And do i have to take the headliner out to take off the f-back... Let me know what all is needed to do if i have to change things in the trunk... well i g2g....TTYL<BR>          Bye<P>             -Alex....||||reg||4
